WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.261
The ability to do something does
not necessarily mean that it

00:00:04.271 --> 00:00:05.372
should be done.

00:00:05.382 --> 00:00:09.322
This principle is useful in
science, business, and the

00:00:09.332 --> 00:00:13.058
management of large
carnivorous attractions.
